{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b337f3af7b83b7f2ea863d7985d259dfcc87a790e835c8d885c3eaa1a7c1ac34", "ja": "（年明けライブが、無事終わった。\n振袖姿の紗代子のステージ、大盛況だったな……）", "zh": "（新年首场演唱会顺利结束了。穿着振袖的纱代子的舞台，真是盛况空前啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "1912a8698de0a2163604dbb0173dcabe1b63842fb3d11cc3a21042e01cc28435", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせしました。\n着替え終わりました。", "zh": "{$P$}，让您久等了。\n我换好衣服了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "31a22852111c894a63832c76a5fd8c02be22097c6f8f1e697f8b00bf575e77aa", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。\n着物を着てのライブはどうだった？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。\n穿着和服参加演出感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "4e2b724bdd5430f2ea710367de6859cd8d4af0ec5df867c05350845aac5db542", "ja": "すごく楽しかったです！　ライブで着物を着るのは\n初めてだったので、なんだか新鮮で……♪", "zh": "特别开心！因为还是第一次穿着和服参加演唱会，所以感觉特别新鲜……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "28e6447ec9d01460aa961c18372df2441c850af591048cb5aaa69a9367d63002", "ja": "最初は、いつもみたいに動けないから、ちゃんと\n盛り上げられるかな？って、心配だったんです。", "zh": "一开始，因为没办法像平时那样自由活动，我还担心能不能好好炒热气氛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "308333d5343bbff8a73297f9a89c5f00523f53b4f10fee76b1580a344afe5795", "ja": "でも、お客さんたちの、楽しそうな声が聞こえて……\nああ良かった、楽しんでくれてるんだ……って！", "zh": "不过，听到了客人们开心的声音……\n啊，太好了，他们玩得很开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cdcf491624fcbf118bfb7a4dbbf48619e2fe37c099be93736931905ad786b1e6", "ja": "そうだな。モニターで見ていても、お客さん達、\nすごく楽しそうだったよ。", "zh": "是啊。就算透过监视器看，客人们也都看起来特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "922b8a95e1de19187b8096005eac09802aa38fed6abd765fe6d53e89d1522889", "ja": "私、着物はあまり着慣れていないので……今回は\nエミリーちゃんたちに、所作を教えてもらったんです。", "zh": "我不太习惯穿和服……这次请爱米莉她们教了我一些礼仪举止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "1e8db97a792c02beb8ca4f5e170cdc24b6086ce4bcd9128293afa8da217ee8c2", "ja": "エミリーちゃんや紬ちゃんみたいには、難しいけど。\nできるだけ、おしとやかに……と思って！", "zh": "虽然要像艾米莉和纺那样还很难，但我想尽量表现得文静一些……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "e5fa0f83c3aad2d134f375f8a7274091e7d82805c52d359633bcef6f452e0af1", "ja": "最初に基本を教えてもらって……\nあとは、ひたすら練習の毎日でした。", "zh": "一开始请人教了我基本功……\n之后就是每天不停地练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "da04b856e0bf9765912ca3357852ef8c7be9865ae4c82de94f72374e3ddfd8fa", "ja": "紗代子は努力家だな。\nその成果は、ちゃんとお客さんに見せられたと思うよ。", "zh": "紗代子真是个努力家啊。你的努力成果，我觉得确实展现给观众看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "370354373d725f4f92c8370fca34f3b5ccdf086467399e418765d5d852a93235", "ja": "きっと、ダンスよりも特別なものが見られたって\n思ってくれたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想，大家一定觉得，比舞蹈更特别的东西也看到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "808b514de9f31f453348bd1e0b0224c7eb36b46ed710139968bee345daf5dfd9", "ja": "ダンスよりも、特別なもの……うん。そうですね。\nみんなも、そう思ってくれてるといいな……。", "zh": "比舞蹈更特别的东西……嗯，确实如此。\n希望大家也能这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "da3380b5b95e6f0f9354b83aa23bfe93b86e4bd48aa30666334597ca4ad1b25b", "ja": "あの……{$P$}は、どうでしたか？\n普段と違う、私のステージ……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}觉得怎么样呢？\n和平常不一样的，我的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "8604d7d8c5e133b5250508176c11cb0d0928c57b1611a999c8d5e9961b5e3e9f", "ja": "みんなみたいには、できなかったかもしれませんけど。\nちょっとは、おしとやかな子に見えましたか……？", "zh": "虽然我可能没能做到像大家那样。\n但有没有稍微看起来像个文静的女孩子呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_1015", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_2000_p", "source_sha256": "eeefa14d289d0752cf9e6e08cf643590fd8c49a12d415e8f65fcd425a1034189", "ja": "もちろん。普段とは雰囲気の違う紗代子に、\n思わず見とれたくらいだよ。", "zh": "当然了。看到和和平时不一样的纱代子，\n我甚至都不自觉地看入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "e83dc773e9656ff25ec46bd6b019a97a9c7e16375d31f985b88cfc5ffc2756ed", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_2002_027say", "source_sha256": "d70632e19f3440d5f59d1694f1f10ac17e2c9d6da97635cdb9945ea834084af3", "ja": "一番近くで見ている人にそう言ってもらうと、\nなんだか、心から大丈夫だって思えますね。", "zh": "能得到一直在最近处看着我的人这样说，总觉得就能发自内心地相信，一定没问题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0163_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "001f6fac9ca9bad01cce82ad2b007beded3be665ca4ec08022965842760f346a", "ja": "今日のライブ、成功して本当に良かったです！\n……今年は、いい年になりそうですね♪　ふふっ！", "zh": "今天的演出能成功，真是太好了！\n……今年看来会是个好年头呢♪ 呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
